1️⃣ Terminal 1: Start the Python AI & SHAP Engine
Open PowerShell and run:

powershell


cd d:\Lifeguard_ai\backend
python -m uvicorn ai_service:app --port 8000
(You will see: Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8000)

2️⃣ Terminal 2: Start the Backend Server & MQTT Broker
Open a second terminal window and run:

powershell


cd d:\Lifeguard_ai\server
node server.js
(You will see: LifeGuard AI server running on http://localhost:5000 and 📡 LifeGuard AI Embedded MQTT Broker listening on port 1883)

3️⃣ Terminal 3: Start the Web Dashboard
Open a third terminal window and run:

powershell


cd d:\Lifeguard_ai\lifeguard_web
npm run dev
(You will see: Local: http://localhost:5173/)